			<div class="content" id="post-content-2530870">
									

<p>+1 as dictated by my &quot;anything that makes me sit there for more than 60 seconds trying to process the full ramifications of gets an upvote&quot; rule.</p>
<p>Addendum: On further processing, I think what I like so much here is the fact that Dr Blackbox is so deep into Time Cube territory that he's taken a chunk of reality with him. The logs are really what make this for me- the combination of vaguely-not-entirely-wrong technobabble and inductive reasoning paint a great picture of a guy who's gone totally off the deep end into madness, but remains blissfully unaware. The difference between this guy and any <em>other</em> otherwise competent scientist suffering a complete mental breakdown and writing a grand unified theory based on E=𝛑<sup>squirrels</sup>? This idea <em>worked</em>.</p>
<p>On a side note, for those having trouble buying into the logs, I present <a href="http://www.aptheory.info/index.html">a thorough explanation of why gases aren't affected by gravity and this proves Earth is the center of the universe and stuff, and that the entire scientific community is a bunch of morons for not realizing these obvious facts.</a> This guy has taken out ads in numerous high-profile science magazines over the past couple years.</p>

